  "ruleText": "Nat 103.05 Meetings. The board shall meet semi-annually and at such additional times called for by:\n\n(a) The chairperson; or\n\n(b) Vote of the board.\n\nSource. #6379, eff 11-26-96; ss by #8299, eff 3-9-05",
